        "money.isZero(), money.isNegative()",
        "Money.sum(values: Money[], currency: string): Money"
      ],
      "gotcha": "There is no constructor from a number and no fromFloat. `Number(minor) / 100` is wrong for a third of ISO 4217 (JPY has no minor unit, KWD has three) and drops digits on large bigints."
    },
    {
      "name": "Quantity",
